Repository licensing summary
===========================

Unless a file states otherwise, this repository is licensed in two parts:

1. Code and documentation
   The analysis code in `code/`, environment files in `environment/`, and
   repository documentation are released under the MIT License.
   See `LICENSE-CODE`.

2. Data and results
   Data tables, recordings, annotations, figures, and derived analysis
   results in `data/` and `results/` are released under the Creative Commons
   Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).
   See `LICENSE-DATA`.
